{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure how users share edition content from the reader."}],"sections":[],"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Sharing","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI"]]},"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Sharing","modules":[{"name":"PSReaderUI"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The PSReaderUI SDK provides built-in sharing through the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/ShareDelegate","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protocol. The SDK ships three ready-to-use providers — "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/ShareProvider","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/WebReaderShareProvider","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/ArticleLinkShareProvider","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — that cover the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"most common scenarios. For full control, implement ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/ShareDelegate","type":"reference"},{"text":" directly.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Key-Concepts","text":"Key Concepts","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Web reader link"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — a URL that opens the edition page in the PageSuite web","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader (e.g., ","type":"text"},{"code":"reader.pagesuite.com\/shortcode\/CODE\/edition\/GUID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). This lets","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"anyone view the page in a browser without installing the app.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Article link","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — a URL pointing to the article on the publisher’s own website"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(e.g., "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"example.com\/news\/article-slug"},{"type":"text","text":"). This link is set by the publisher in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the CMS and is only available for article-type pages that have a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shareLink"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"configured."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both link types are surfaced through the iOS share sheet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIActivityViewController"},{"type":"text","text":"). The built-in providers automatically include a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Copy Link","type":"text"}]},{"text":" activity alongside the standard system activities.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Choosing-a-Share-Policy","text":"Choosing a Share Policy","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/ShareProvider","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" wraps one or both of the built-in providers and applies a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fallback strategy through its "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/ShareProvider\/SharePolicy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"r